  "user_request_original": "Design and optimize a 16-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2-HfO2-SiO2. Fix layers 1, 2, 15, 16 to 75.0nm each. Optimize layers 3-14 (12 inner layers) with quadratic chirp thickness parameterization. Enforce maximum inter-layer thickness delta constraint |Δd|≤25nm during optimization. Wavelength bands: maximize transmittance 1530-1565nm, maximize reflectance 400-700nm. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with smoothness constraint. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Design and optimize a 16-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica with air incidence. Fix outer four layers to 75.0 nm thickness. Optimize 12 inner alternating layers using gradient-based thickness optimization with quadratic chirp parameterization and a maximum inter-layer thickness difference of 25 nm. Maximize transmittance in 1530–1565 nm and maximize reflectance in 400–700 nm.",
